{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++ header", "description": "This file defines the abstract class `GeneratorImpl`, which models a pseudo-random number generator (PRNG) within the ATen library of PyTorch. It contains method declarations for setting and getting generator state, seed, and offset, as well as thread-safety considerations via a mutex. The class is designed for inheritance by specific generator implementations and manages device and key set properties. Additionally, it includes utility functions in the `detail` namespace for non-deterministic randomness.", "external_files": ["<cstdint>", "<mutex>", "<c10/core/Device.h>", "<c10/core/DispatchKeySet.h>", "<c10/core/TensorImpl.h>", "<c10/macros/Export.h>", "<c10/util/intrusive_ptr.h>", "<c10/util/python_stub.h>"], "external_methods": ["c10::intrusive_ptr_target", "c10::intrusive_ptr", "c10::TensorImpl", "c10::Device", "c10::DispatchKeySet", "c10::detail::getNonDeterministicRandom"], "published": ["c10::GeneratorImpl", "c10::detail::getNonDeterministicRandom"], "classes": [{"name": "GeneratorImpl", "description": "An abstract class representing a generic generator for pseudo-random numbers, providing interface methods to manage generator state, seed, and device properties, with thread safety support."}], "methods": [{"name": "GeneratorImpl", "description": "Constructor initializing the generator with a specific device and key set."}, {"name": "clone", "description": "Creates a copy of the generator instance."}, {"name": "set_current_seed", "description": "Pure virtual method to set the generator's seed."}, {"name": "set_offset", "description": "Pure virtual method to set the generator's offset."}, {"name": "get_offset", "description": "Pure virtual method to retrieve the generator's current offset."}, {"name": "current_seed", "description": "Pure virtual method to get the current seed of the generator."}, {"name": "seed", "description": "Pure virtual method to obtain the seed value used to initialize the generator."}, {"name": "set_state", "description": "Pure virtual method to set the generator's internal state."}, {"name": "get_state", "description": "Pure virtual method to retrieve the generator's internal state."}, {"name": "graphsafe_set_state", "description": "Sets the generator's state in a graph-safe manner."}, {"name": "graphsafe_get_state", "description": "Retrieves the generator's state in a graph-safe manner."}, {"name": "device", "description": "Returns the device associated with the generator."}, {"name": "void set_pyobj(PyObject * pyobj)", "description": "Assigns a Python object to the generator.", "scope": "c10::GeneratorImpl", "scopeKind": "struct"}, {"name": "PyObject * pyobj() const", "description": "Returns the associated Python object.", "scope": "c10::GeneratorImpl", "scopeKind": "struct"}, {"name": "DispatchKeySet key_set() const", "scope": "c10::GeneratorImpl", "scopeKind": "struct", "description": "unavailable"}], "calls": ["c10::intrusive_ptr<GeneratorImpl>::clone()", "c10::GeneratorImpl::set_current_seed", "c10::GeneratorImpl::set_offset", "c10::GeneratorImpl::get_offset", "c10::GeneratorImpl::current_seed", "c10::GeneratorImpl::seed", "c10::GeneratorImpl::set_state", "c10::GeneratorImpl::get_state", "c10::GeneratorImpl::graphsafe_set_state", "c10::GeneratorImpl::graphsafe_get_state", "c10::GeneratorImpl::device", "c10::GeneratorImpl::set_pyobj", "c10::GeneratorImpl::pyobj", "c10::detail::getNonDeterministicRandom"], "search-terms": ["GeneratorImpl", "intrusive_ptr_target", "set_current_seed", "graphsafe", "non-deterministic"], "state": 2, "file_id": 2970, "knowledge_revision": 22370, "git_revision": "38d3c27849305ee7834bfe68f72b30b73f6abefd", "ctags": [{"_type": "tag", "name": "GeneratorImpl", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/pytorch-309884/c10/core/GeneratorImpl.h", "pattern": "/^struct C10_API GeneratorImpl : public c10::intrusive_ptr_target {$/", "language": "C++", "kind": "struct", "scope": "c10", "scopeKind": "namespace"}